<h1>The Loop Debugging Checklist</h1>

<p>Before fixing AI-generated code, QA teams test first. The checklist below isn't a fix-it list, it's a diagnostic tool: the goal is to identify exactly which check catches the problem before touching a single line of code.</p>

<p>Below is a real prompt and the loop AI generated for it. Work through all five checks and find which one actually catches the bug.</p>

